# Add a feed: the address field with the on-screen keyboard (no physical keyboard: the shared rule), Find feed on a site's
# address (the feed is discovered from its page), Pin; a feed's own address; the failures in plain words: a page with no
# feed, a site that does not answer, no network, something that is not an address; Stop while it looks.
seed refresh_on_open off
keyboard off
wait 900
key down
key down
key down
key enter
wait 700
expect state page add
expect osk on
expect state typing add
shot 01-add-osk
check add-osk
type blog.example.org
wait 200
shot 02-typed
key enter
wait 900
expect osk off
expect state add_state 2
expect text "Found: An Example Blog  ·  5 articles"
shot 03-found
check found
tap "Pin"
wait 600
expect state add_state 4
expect text "Added to your favorites: An Example Blog"
shot 04-pinned
type feeds.example.net/releases.atom
key enter
wait 900
expect text "Found: Example Releases  ·  3 articles"
shot 05-direct-feed
tap "Cancel"
wait 400
expect state add_state 0
key esc
wait 300
key esc
wait 300
expect state page home
key enter
wait 600
type nofeed.example.com
key enter
wait 1200
expect state add_state 3
shot 06-no-feed
check no-feed
# a failure leaves the keyboard down: one Esc leaves the page
key esc
wait 300
expect state page home
key enter
wait 600
type slow.example.com
key enter
wait 900
expect text "Timed out: the site did not answer."
shot 07-timed-out
key esc
wait 300
net offline
key enter
wait 600
type blog.example.org
key enter
wait 900
expect text "No network: check the Wi-Fi and try again."
shot 08-offline
net online
key esc
wait 300
key enter
wait 600
type nothing
key enter
wait 600
expect text "That is not a web address. Type a site (example.com) or the address of its feed."
shot 09-not-an-address
key esc
wait 300
# with a keyboard: no on-screen keyboard, the field has the keys at once
keyboard on
key enter
wait 600
expect osk off
type korben.info/feed
shot 10-keyboard
net slow 3000
key enter
wait 300
expect state add_state 1
shot 11-looking
key esc
wait 800
expect state add_state 3
expect text "Stopped."
shot 12-stopped
net slow 0
key esc
wait 300
key home
key enter
wait 600
expect state page favorites
shot 13-favorites-with-added
